expected_issues.description:
`lv_xml.h` is included twice (once before `#if LV_USE_XML` and again right after). This is likely redundant and can be removed to avoid confusion/compile overhead. If the first include is needed for the `LV_USE_XML` macro, keep the first and drop the second.

```suggestion
#include "lv_xml.h"
#if LV_USE_XML

#include "lv_xml_base_types.h"
```

